# Digital Observatory environment variables
#
# The observatory loads apps/hdri/.env automatically via @syrokomskyi/observatory-crypto/auto-env,
# which walks up from cwd until it finds a .env file.
# Copy apps/hdri/.env.example to apps/hdri/.env and fill in the values.
#
# No additional app-specific env vars are required.
# All observatory configuration lives in .input/brief.md
